      <p>Average retail price (MSRP): <strong>$191.17</strong>. Average resale clearing price: <strong>$273.23</strong>. The mean resale premium of <span class="highlight-num">$82.06</span> per pair translates to a <span class="highlight-num">1.43x</span> average multiplier over retail.</p>
